<title>USA: HCC says shareholders approve AVEMCO merger.</title>
<headline>HCC says shareholders approve AVEMCO merger.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>HCC Insurance Holdings Inc, an international specialty insurance group, said shareholders of HCC and AVEMCO Corp had each approved the previously announced merger of HCC and AVEMCO valued at approximately $256 million.</p>
<p>As a result of such merger, shareholders of AVEMCO will receive one share of HCC common stock for each share of AVEMCO common stock.</p>
<p>AVEMCO's shares ceased trading on the NYSE at the close of busines on June 17.</p>
